{"severity":"error","file":"errors/linear_used_twice_32.march","start_line":21,"start_col":31,"end_line":21,"end_col":34,"message":"The linear value `st4` is used more than once here.\nLinear values must be consumed exactly once — they cannot be copied or ignored.","code":"linear_used_twice","fix":null,"labels":[{"file":"errors/linear_used_twice_32.march","start_line":20,"start_col":37,"end_line":20,"end_col":40,"message":"`st4` was already consumed here"}],"notes":["This is a protocol state, and the first use closed the conversation: no step can follow `close`.","The conversation so far, in protocol `Relay`:\n\n  … 2 earlier steps\n  reply:  C -> A : Bool     done\n  third:  A -> B : String   done\n  fourth: B -> A : Bool     done   <- `A` tried this again\n  (end of conversation)     <- `A` can only close here"],"category":"LINEARITY"}
